# The relay image needs only the Go sources (deploy/relay/Dockerfile),
# and the files of the one package outside them that its programs build
# in: the DSH bridge plugin aided carries (apps/dsh-bridge/embed.go
# embeds the rest). Nothing else of apps/ comes in.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!internal
!pkg
!gen/go
!apps/dsh-bridge/embed.go
!apps/dsh-bridge/package.json
!apps/dsh-bridge/cordis.patch.yml
!apps/dsh-bridge/README.md
!apps/dsh-bridge/lib
